      "text": "FDA's history shows an earlier potassium chloride shortage first posted on 2021-11-02, since resolved, and the drug is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1075479 ended 2018-12-21 and was classified VAI, 1047 days before the 2021-11-02 posting.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1106244 ended 2019-09-06 and was classified OAI, with a classification letter dated 2020-05-25, 788 days before the 2021-11-02 posting.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1110899 ended 2019-11-21 and was classified VAI, with a classification letter dated 2020-02-12, 712 days before the 2021-11-02 posting.",
      "cites": ["D14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1121028 ended 2020-02-28 and was classified VAI, with a classification letter dated 2020-04-17, 613 days before the 2021-11-02 posting.",
      "cites": ["D15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued on 2020-03-25, 587 days before the 2021-11-02 posting.",
      "cites": ["D16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 31 bags of 29.8 g/1000 mL, 50 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East from 2.7 days to 5 days on hand while Corvale General retains 14 days.",
